OL,3,ANowak family say police footage
OL,4,Adeepened trauma
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis father Mark, stepmother Katie,
OL,7,Fmother Lucy and sister Olivia were
OL,8,Fspeaking to ITV for the documentary
OL,9,FDear Henry: Our Fight For Justice.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
