OL,3,AShops looted as German cost-of-living
OL,4,Aprotests turn violent
OL,5,
OL,6,FRioters looted shops in central
OL,7,FFrankfurt late on Saturday as clashes
OL,8,Ferupted in German cities over the cost
OL,9,Fof living.
OL,11,FBesides Frankfurt - Germany's financial
OL,12,Fhub - there were incidents of violence
OL,13,Fin Berlin, Cologne and Hamburg, with
OL,14,Fpolice saying they used water cannon to
OL,15,Fdisperse protesters who were targeting
OL,16,Femergency workers with fireworks,
OL,17,Fstones and bottles.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
