OL,3,AArmed police start patrols in Sydney
OL,4,Aafter Bondi Beach attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeavily-armed police officers have
OL,7,Fstarted patrolling Sydney's streets, as
OL,8,Fpart of heightened security measures
OL,9,Ffollowing last year's deadly shooting
OL,10,Fat Bondi Beach.
OL,12,FThe Armed Response Command (ARC) will
OL,13,Fsee specially trained officers in busy
OL,14,Ftourist areas carrying long-arm rifles
OL,15,F` an unfamiliar sight for most
OL,16,Fresidents.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
