OL,3,AArmed police start patrols in Sydney
OL,4,Aafter Bondi Beach attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew South Wales police say the officers
OL,7,Fwill also patrol major events like
OL,8,Fsports matches and places of worship
OL,9,F"to prevent, deter and rapidly respond
OL,10,Fto serious threats, including active
OL,11,Farmed offender incidents".
OL,13,FFifteen people - including a
OL,14,F10-year-old girl ` were killed in
OL,15,FDecember when two gunmen opened fire on
OL,16,Fan event marking the Jewish festival of
OL,17,FHanukkah at the popular beach.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
